desc = "Though he has since gone to therapy to overcome his intense loneliness and insecurity, the war has made Loan Shark revert to his old ways — he fights ruthlessly, a skill he developed in his days as a crime boss. If you aren’t careful on the battlefield, he may repossess your assets…"
